{{Politics of Balisca}}

The [[Cosmopolitan Collective]] ({{lang-bl|Colectivo Cosmopolita}}) is a [[W:Platformism|platform federation]] of political organization within [[Baliscan Confederation|Balisca]] that subscribe to a variety of [[W:Post left anarchism|post-left]] positions, including [[Baliscan Accelerationism]], with heavy {{W|technological utopianism|techno-utopian elements}}. It traces it's roots to the ''[[Cosmocazo]]'' period of Baliscan history.

The Collective additionally supports facets of the idea of {{W|cosmopolitanism}}, and advancing Balisca's closer integration with the greater world. They are pro-[[W:free migration|free migration]], pro-[[wikipedia:internationalism|internationalism]], strongly [[W:Nontheism|nontheistic]] and [[W:Anti-clericalism|anti-clerical]]. Members of the Cosmopolitan Collective have held numerous position in successive [[Government and politics of Balisca|confederal administrations]] since the 1930s.

Confederal delegates who are affiliated with the Collective have been nicknamed ''cosmopolites''.

